{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:5719ff890b54302c","name":"Surveillance Talent Tree","source":{"id":"source:reference-5719ff890b54302c","title":"Surveillance Talent Tree","revision":20064,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T23:08:07Z","sha256":"3a9839412261e8e7a7f524498761efdd5a29e40e75d199b9d083324ff85d639d","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=20064","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Surveillance%20Talent%20Tree&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-5719ff890b54302c","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Clone Wars Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Clone_Wars_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["You have mastered the art of surveillance, transforming the information you gather with scouting into a distinct advantage on the battlefield.\n"]},"\n\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Core Talents"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Advanced Intel"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisite:"]}," ",{"tag":"b","children":["Spotter"]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["If you are not ",{"tag":"a","children":["Surprised"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Surprised"}," at the beginning of combat, you can use the ",{"tag":"b","children":["Spotter"]}," Talent as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Free Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Free_Action"}," on your first turn, including during the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Surprise Round"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Surprise_Round"},".\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Hidden Eyes"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["If you have ",{"tag":"a","children":["Concealment"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Concealment"}," from a target, you gain a +5 circumstance bonus on all ",{"tag":"a","children":["Perception"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Perception","referenceId":"reference:bd18e320a6bb9f53"}," checks made against that target.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Hunt the Hunter"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["When you use a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Standard Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Standard_Action"}," to actively look for hidden enemies, you can make a single ",{"tag":"a","children":["Melee Attack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Melee_Attack"}," or ",{"tag":"a","children":["Ranged Attack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Ranged_Attack"}," against any one enemy you notice with your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Perception"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Perception","referenceId":"reference:bd18e320a6bb9f53"}," check.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Seek and Destroy"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisite:"]}," ",{"tag":"b","children":["Hidden Eyes"]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["If you make a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Charge"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Charge","referenceId":"reference:ff9f88ce353a2228"}," attack against a target that is unaware of you, that target cannot make a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Perception"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Perception","referenceId":"reference:bd18e320a6bb9f53"}," check to notice you until after the attack is resolved, even if you move away from ",{"tag":"a","children":["Cover"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Cover"}," or ",{"tag":"a","children":["Concealment"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Concealment"},".\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Spotter"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["As a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Move Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Move_Action"},", you can make a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Perception"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Perception","referenceId":"reference:bd18e320a6bb9f53"}," check with a DC equal to 10 + the CL of a single target enemy in your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Line of Sight"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Line_of_Sight","referenceId":"reference:7ae5eaf79143552f"},". If you succeed on the check, you and all your allies that can hear and understand you gain a +1 insight bonus on attack rolls against that target until the end of your next turn.\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
